# Handoff

This Research-owned Process Inbox contains open received deltas only. Operations submits candidate deltas through its role-owned outbox. A Verification Finding enters this inbox only after the Operator authorizes routing to Research. Research verifies each source and current target, integrates durable content into the responsible document, records the result in `knowledge/journal.md`, and removes the processed point.

## Open handoff points

No open handoff points.
